; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; EAStatsReporter — preset for EA "MegiHedge v2.0"
; Load in MetaTrader 5: attach EAStatsReporter to a chart →
;   Inputs tab → "Load" → select this .set file → OK
;
; IMPORTANT
;  1. Replace the Secret value below with the real
;     EA_WEBHOOK_SECRET (same value as on Vercel).
;  2. The eaStats doc for eaId = "megihedge" already exists in
;     Sanity (account 97055476 · Interstellar · USC cent account).
;     Set updateMode = "daily" (hourly throttle) or "realtime"
;     BEFORE the first push — while it is "off" the webhook
;     answers {ok:true, skipped:"off"} and writes nothing.
;  3. Tools → Options → Expert Advisors → Allow WebRequest, add
;     https://www.laoforextrader.com — the www host, NOT the apex:
;     laoforextrader.com 307-redirects to www and MT5 WebRequest
;     follows it as GET, which this route answers with 405.
;  4. First send runs the one-time history bootstrap (big RAM
;     spike). State lands in MQL5/Files/EAStatsReporter_megihedge.dat
;     — restart MT5 afterwards and RAM returns to baseline.
;
; BrokerName is only a display label on the site; change it if the
; live MegiHedge account moves to another broker.
; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
WebhookURL=https://www.laoforextrader.com/api/ea/stats
Secret=changeme
EAID=megihedge
BrokerName=Interstellar
IntervalMin=60
SendOnStart=true
BootstrapChunkDays=7
PersistState=true
